    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū ba lūganda lwa Balekabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyū gūkiza kūlī Yelemia kūfuma kūlī SEEBA mu shikū ja būsugi bong'wa Yehoyakimu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosia ū ntemi wa sī ya Yuda; gūng'wīla: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ū kū banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Lekabu, ūkabawīle bize ū mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, mu chumba shimò shaho, hūna ūbatengele walwa bo kūng'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūja kūng'wenha Yazania ng'wana Yelemia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Habasinia, na baana ba ng'wawe; na a bitūnja bakwe a bose pye, nīyo pyī ī numba ya Balekabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbenha ū mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, mu chumba sha bitūnja ba ng'wana Hanaani, ng'wana Igidalia, munhū o ng'wa Mulungu. Ī chumba shenīsho shalī hihī na chumba sha bataale, na shalī higūlya ya chumba sha ng'wa Maaseya, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shalumu, nang'hani wa nyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nokaja divai mu mabakuli na shikombe, nūbenhela a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Lekabu benabo; niza nūbinha nalībawīla, “Yīyī divai mung'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būnishokeja balīhaya, “A bise tūtang'waga ī divai, nguno ū sīswe nkūlū ū Yonadabu, ng'wana Lekabu watwinha shilagīlo ūtūwīla, ‘A bing'we nū būbyīle wing'we mutī ba kūng'wa divai ilalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya nūūlū kūzenga numba, nūūlū kūlīma gīkī mubībe mbīyū; nī migūnda ya mizabibu yaya ū kūbiza nayo. Yaya gete a bing'we ū kūbiza nasho ī shenīshi; nī numba jing'we jikūbiza ja maheema pyī ī shikū. Ū mu gīko hū mukūlama shikū ningī ū mu sī ūmo mukwikalaga mu mbika ya kūsaama saama ī haha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nise twīdima pyī īyo watūlagīla ū sīswe nkūlū Yonadabu, ng'wana Lekabu. Tūtaalī kūgema kūng'wa divai; a bise benekīlī na a bake bise, na a bitūnja bise pye na a bshīke bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtaalī nūūlū kūzenga numba ja kwikala mo, nūūlū kūbiza na migūnda ya mizabibū, nūūlū malaale; nūūlū ni shilīwa sha kūlīma tūtaalī kūbiza nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūlī bikaji ba mu mahema kūlwa nguno ya kūshikīlīja pyī īyo watūlagīla ū sīswe nkūlū Yonadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Nebukadineza, ū ntemi wa Babuloni aho wiza kwīyūūbūkīla ī sī yenīyī, tūkiwīla; ‘Bing'we tūjagi Yelusalemu tūgapeele a mabità ga Bakalidayo, na a ga Baalamu.’ Hūna tūbiza bazengi ba mu Yelusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwiza ū kūlī Yelemia; gūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya, ‘Jaga ūkabawīle a banhū ba Yuda na a bazengi ba Yelusalemu gīkī, A bing'we, ni kinehe mutadūgije ū kwilangīla henaho mubize bigwi ū kū mihayo yane?’ Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lekabu wabinha shilagīlo a baana bakwe, gīkī batizūng'wa divai; na ng'hana ī shilagīlo shenīsho shilang'hanilwe. Kūshisha lelo batang'waga divai nguno ya kūdima shilagīlo sha ng'wa saabo nkūlū. Alīyo ū nene gwa ū kūmukomeleja, ning'we biya ū kūniigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamutūmīla no pye a batūmami bane a bahangi; bikalaga būmuwīla gwa gwa gwa, ‘Bing'we galūkagi, būlī ūmò wing'we īnge ū mu nzīla jing'we ī jabūbi, mugalūche nī nhūngwa jing'we; lekagi ū kwikala ng'ūlondeela bamulungu bangī na kūbalamya. Ū mu gīko hū mukwikala ū mu sī īyo nang'winha bing'we na bakūlūgenji bing'we.’ Alīyo ng'walī mulemile ū kūnidegeleka nūūlū ū kūniigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana ba ng'wa Yonadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lekabu, bashidimile ī shilagīlo īsho wabinha nkūlūgenji wabo; alīyo a banhū aba balemile ū kūniigwa ū nene.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, nalīhaya gīkī, ‘Degelekai! A banhū ba Yuda na a bazengi ba mu Yelusalemu pye a bose nalī hihī kūbenhela pye a mayanga ayo naagahaya kūlwa nguno yabo. Nguno naabawīla no, alīyo balemile ū kūniigwa; naabitana no, alīyo ū kūniidīka biya.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yelemia ūbawīla a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Lekabu, “Ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī, ‘A bing'we mushiigwile ī shilagīlo sha nkūlūgenji wing'we Yonadabu, na mukashimīzīlaga mu katongeelele kakwe kose, nī yīyo amulagīlile mukīyītaga pye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū Yonadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lekabu atalagayiwa munhū wa kūnitūmamīla.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
